            "title": "Burst Angel: Angel&#x27;s Adolescence -  Minoru Murao",
            "summary": "This manga prequel to the anime Burts Angel, produzed by Gonzo animation studio, and was written and illustrated by Minoru&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>This manga prequel to the anime Burts Angel, produzed by Gonzo animation studio, and was written and illustrated by Minoru Murao from 2004 to 2005, collected in 3 volumes by MediaWorks.</p>\n<p>This is the first Japanesse volume, with the author signature and a very funny illustration, </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-7.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-7-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-8.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-8-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-4.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/11/gallery/shared-image-4-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
