        {
            "id": "https://otaku-collector.com/tokyo-tribe-2-santa-inoue.html",
            "url": "https://otaku-collector.com/tokyo-tribe-2-santa-inoue.html",
            "title": "Tokyo Tribe 2 - Santa Inoue",
            "summary": "This continuation of the single volume Tokyo Tribe is know also as Tokyo Tribes, is a manga of Santa Inoue&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>This continuation of the single volume Tokyo Tribe is know also as Tokyo Tribes, is a manga of Santa Inoue and was serialized in the magazine Boom from 1997 to 2005 collected in 12 volumes.</p>\n<p>This title has a manga spin-off and continuations (Tokyo Tribe 2: Spin Off!, Tokyo Tribe 3 and Tokyo Tribe Waru) an anime with 13 episodes and a live actiion adaptation.</p>\n<p>This particular volume is the 3td of the Tokyo Tribe 2 series, and it has Santa Inoue signature and a simple illustration of the main character, Kai.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-5.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-5-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-6.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-6-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-2.jpg\" data-size=\"2040x1530\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/gallery/shared-image-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
            "image": "https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/10/shared-image-1.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "Xico"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Tokyo Tribe 2",
                   "Santa Inoue",
                   "Manga"
