        },
        {
            "id": "https://otaku-collector.com/cels-dougas-gengas-what-does-this-mean.html",
            "url": "https://otaku-collector.com/cels-dougas-gengas-what-does-this-mean.html",
            "title": "Cels, Dougas, Gengas ... What does this mean?",
            "summary": "Collecting animation production material is something that I don't usually do, but in the mid-00s, I got some from the&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Collecting animation production material is something that I <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-2\" data-original-text=\"dont\" data-corrected-text=\"don't\" data-pos=\"65\" data-len=\"5\">don't</span> usually do, but in the mid-00s, I got some from the usual suspect (Mandarake), and sometimes <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-10\" data-original-text=\"is\" data-corrected-text=\"it's\" data-pos=\"167\" data-len=\"4\">it's</span> a little <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-13\" data-original-text=\"dificult\" data-corrected-text=\"difficult\" data-pos=\"189\" data-len=\"9\">difficult</span> to know what is what <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-16\" data-original-text=\",\" data-corrected-text=\".\" data-pos=\"220\" data-len=\"1\">.</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-19\" data-original-text=\"and\" data-corrected-text=\"For\" data-pos=\"225\" data-len=\"3\">For</span> that <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-23\" data-original-text=\"for\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"237\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-26\" data-original-text=\"i\" data-corrected-text=\"I\" data-pos=\"240\" data-len=\"1\">I</span> will try to explain some of the terminology of this material.</div>\n<p><strong>1. Cels</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   Transparent plastic sheets painted with acrylic paint <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-32\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;\" data-corrected-text=\"are\" data-pos=\"393\" data-len=\"3\">are</span> used to make frames of animation <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-35\" data-original-text=\",\" data-corrected-text=\".\" data-pos=\"430\" data-len=\"1\">.</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-38\" data-original-text=\"then\" data-corrected-text=\"Then\" data-pos=\"436\" data-len=\"4\">Then</span> the completed cels are photographed one by one against a painted background by a rostrum camera onto motion picture film to produce the final animation.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2982\" height=\"2609\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_1-xs.png 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_1-sm.png 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_1-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"> </div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   The cels, dougas, and sometimes gengas have information <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-51\" data-original-text=\"of\" data-corrected-text=\"about\" data-pos=\"670\" data-len=\"5\">about</span> the sequence (sequence of animation or \"shot\") that usually <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-54\" data-original-text=\"have\" data-corrected-text=\"has\" data-pos=\"740\" data-len=\"3\">has</span> a letter and a number, <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-57\" data-original-text=\"that\" data-corrected-text=\"which\" data-pos=\"771\" data-len=\"5\">which</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-60\" data-original-text=\"gives\" data-corrected-text=\"indicates\" data-pos=\"782\" data-len=\"9\">indicates</span> the cel layer (A=first layer, B=second layer). <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-65\" data-original-text=\"if\" data-corrected-text=\"If\" data-pos=\"841\" data-len=\"2\">If</span> the cel <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-68\" data-original-text=\"have\" data-corrected-text=\"has\" data-pos=\"856\" data-len=\"3\">has</span> multiple layers (for movement of the mouth or eyes), the number of the cel in the sequence <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-74\" data-original-text=\"and\" data-corrected-text=\"is indicated\" data-pos=\"955\" data-len=\"12\">is indicated</span> (A 2 = top layer of the <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-77\" data-original-text=\"2º\" data-corrected-text=\"2nd\" data-pos=\"994\" data-len=\"3\">2nd</span> cel in the sequence). The first and the last cels of the sequence are called \"key cels,\" and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-85\" data-original-text=\"becose\" data-corrected-text=\"because\" data-pos=\"1099\" data-len=\"7\">because</span> they are done by the main animators, they are more valuable, as the \"in- <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-92\" data-original-text=\"between\" data-corrected-text=\"betweens\" data-pos=\"1186\" data-len=\"9\">betweens\"</span> are handled by other animation staff or sometimes outsourced.</div>\n<p><strong>2. Background</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\"><span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-97\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;    Normaly\" data-corrected-text=\"Normally\" data-pos=\"1307\" data-len=\"8\">   Normally</span> made with <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-100\" data-original-text=\"watercolour\" data-corrected-text=\"watercolor\" data-pos=\"1337\" data-len=\"10\">watercolor</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-103\" data-original-text=\"in\" data-corrected-text=\"on\" data-pos=\"1350\" data-len=\"2\">on</span> cardboard and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-108\" data-original-text=\"in\" data-corrected-text=\"larger\" data-pos=\"1370\" data-len=\"6\">larger</span> than the cel <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-113\" data-original-text=\".\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"1402\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-116\" data-original-text=\"They\" data-corrected-text=\"they\" data-pos=\"1408\" data-len=\"4\">they</span> are more <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-119\" data-original-text=\"dificult\" data-corrected-text=\"difficult\" data-pos=\"1430\" data-len=\"9\">difficult</span> to find than other production material, as they are <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-122\" data-original-text=\"reuse\" data-corrected-text=\"reused\" data-pos=\"1497\" data-len=\"6\">reused</span> in various shots and sometimes <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-126\" data-original-text=\",\" data-corrected-text=\"throughout\" data-pos=\"1536\" data-len=\"10\">throughout</span> various episodes <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-129\" data-original-text=\",\" data-corrected-text=\".\" data-pos=\"1564\" data-len=\"1\">.</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-132\" data-original-text=\"and\" data-corrected-text=\"Because\" data-pos=\"1569\" data-len=\"7\">Because</span> of that <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-136\" data-original-text=\"becose\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"1591\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> there are <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-141\" data-original-text=\"less\" data-corrected-text=\"fewer\" data-pos=\"1607\" data-len=\"5\">fewer</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-144\" data-original-text=\"backgounds\" data-corrected-text=\"backgrounds\" data-pos=\"1623\" data-len=\"11\">backgrounds</span> than cels.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/7.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"974\" height=\"646\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/7-xs.webp 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/7-sm.webp 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/7-md.webp 768w\"></figure>\n<p><strong>3. Dougas</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\"><span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-149\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;   This\" data-corrected-text=\"These\" data-pos=\"1687\" data-len=\"5\">   These</span> are the pre-cel <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-152\" data-original-text=\"sketch\" data-corrected-text=\"sketches\" data-pos=\"1715\" data-len=\"8\">sketches</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-155\" data-original-text=\"in\" data-corrected-text=\"on\" data-pos=\"1726\" data-len=\"2\">on</span> paper, drawn with <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-158\" data-original-text=\"diferent\" data-corrected-text=\"different\" data-pos=\"1755\" data-len=\"9\">different</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-161\" data-original-text=\"colous\" data-corrected-text=\"colors\" data-pos=\"1771\" data-len=\"6\">colors</span> and sometimes with <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-164\" data-original-text=\"anotations\" data-corrected-text=\"annotations\" data-pos=\"1807\" data-len=\"11\">annotations</span> for the creation of the cel.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3151\" height=\"2858\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_2-xs.png 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_2-sm.png 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Daa-Daa-Daa-03_2-md.png 768w\"></figure>\n<p><strong>4. Gengas</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   Before dougas, main animators <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-171\" data-original-text=\"to\" data-corrected-text=\"created\" data-pos=\"1917\" data-len=\"7\">created</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-174\" data-original-text=\"give\" data-corrected-text=\"sketches\" data-pos=\"1929\" data-len=\"8\">sketches</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-177\" data-original-text=\"the\" data-corrected-text=\"called\" data-pos=\"1941\" data-len=\"6\">called</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-180\" data-original-text=\"reference\" data-corrected-text=\"gengas\" data-pos=\"1957\" data-len=\"6\">gengas</span> to <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-183\" data-original-text=\"make\" data-corrected-text=\"provide\" data-pos=\"1971\" data-len=\"7\">provide</span> reference for making the dougas (and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-188\" data-original-text=\"subsequence\" data-corrected-text=\"subsequently\" data-pos=\"2027\" data-len=\"12\">subsequently</span> the cels). <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-193\" data-original-text=\"drawn\" data-corrected-text=\"They\" data-pos=\"2056\" data-len=\"4\">They</span> can be <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-198\" data-original-text=\"lees\" data-corrected-text=\"less\" data-pos=\"2100\" data-len=\"4\">less</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-201\" data-original-text=\"pulished\" data-corrected-text=\"polished\" data-pos=\"2113\" data-len=\"8\">polished</span> than the douga. Sometimes, they made yellow paper gengas that are corrections of <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-206\" data-original-text=\"a\" data-corrected-text=\"an\" data-pos=\"2204\" data-len=\"2\">an</span> initial douga to be redone.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/GZQdFIjbkAEHurJ.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"526\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/GZQdFIjbkAEHurJ-xs.jpg 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/GZQdFIjbkAEHurJ-sm.jpg 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/GZQdFIjbkAEHurJ-md.jpg 768w\"></figure>\n<p><strong>6. Layout</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   A layout is a more detailed storyboard frame that defines the composition of the sequence, including background, camera angle <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-215\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"2398\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> and character placement.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/Yas-layout.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"424\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Yas-layout-xs.webp 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Yas-layout-sm.webp 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/Yas-layout-md.webp 768w\"></figure>\n<p><strong>7. Storyboard</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   This is the complete view of the episode, with all the sequences, <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-225\" data-original-text=\"timmings\" data-corrected-text=\"timings,\" data-pos=\"2541\" data-len=\"8\">timings,</span> and information for the production company to be able to create the animation. Some have detailed drawings, and some are only <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-232\" data-original-text=\"a\" data-corrected-text=\"references\" data-pos=\"2677\" data-len=\"10\">references</span> for the action of the scene.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/1d9a4f5a7fdcc4d26d36c28736e0f14102e600f5_hq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"451\" height=\"640\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/1d9a4f5a7fdcc4d26d36c28736e0f14102e600f5_hq-xs.jpg 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/1d9a4f5a7fdcc4d26d36c28736e0f14102e600f5_hq-sm.jpg 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/1d9a4f5a7fdcc4d26d36c28736e0f14102e600f5_hq-md.jpg 768w\"></figure>\n<p><strong>8. Settings</strong></p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">   A compilation of drawings <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-244\" data-original-text=\"to\" data-corrected-text=\"serves\" data-pos=\"2795\" data-len=\"6\">serves</span> as <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-248\" data-original-text=\"serve\" data-corrected-text=\"a\" data-pos=\"2811\" data-len=\"1\">a</span> reference for all the animators, containing all characters, some in various positions, <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-253\" data-original-text=\"info\" data-corrected-text=\"and\" data-pos=\"2912\" data-len=\"3\">and</span> information about sizes and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-258\" data-original-text=\"colours\" data-corrected-text=\"colors\" data-pos=\"2951\" data-len=\"6\">colors</span> , backgrounds, and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-263\" data-original-text=\"artefacts\" data-corrected-text=\"artifacts\" data-pos=\"2985\" data-len=\"9\">artifacts</span> . This part is <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-266\" data-original-text=\"esencial\" data-corrected-text=\"essential\" data-pos=\"3017\" data-len=\"9\">essential</span> to <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-269\" data-original-text=\"have\" data-corrected-text=\"ensure\" data-pos=\"3034\" data-len=\"6\">ensure</span> consistency <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-274\" data-original-text=\"of\" data-corrected-text=\"in\" data-pos=\"3088\" data-len=\"2\">in</span> the animation.</div>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/b771f5f8-dbe6-43fb-91c9-830f908a60fb_1293x888.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1293\" height=\"888\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/b771f5f8-dbe6-43fb-91c9-830f908a60fb_1293x888-xs.jpg 300w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/b771f5f8-dbe6-43fb-91c9-830f908a60fb_1293x888-sm.jpg 480w ,https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/responsive/b771f5f8-dbe6-43fb-91c9-830f908a60fb_1293x888-md.jpg 768w\"></figure>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\"><span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-277\" data-original-text=\"They\" data-corrected-text=\"There\" data-pos=\"3121\" data-len=\"5\">There</span> are more production items out there, but this is most of the categories I found in my search for interesting things to have <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-280\" data-original-text=\",\" data-corrected-text=\".\" data-pos=\"3251\" data-len=\"1\">.</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-283\" data-original-text=\"if\" data-corrected-text=\"If\" data-pos=\"3255\" data-len=\"2\">If</span> I made a mistake <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-288\" data-original-text=\"of\" data-corrected-text=\"or\" data-pos=\"3278\" data-len=\"2\">or</span> if you want to share any info, please <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-291\" data-original-text=\"coment\" data-corrected-text=\"comment\" data-pos=\"3325\" data-len=\"7\">comment</span> below.</div>\n<p> </p>",
            "image": "https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/9/ippo_03_1.png",
