        {
            "id": "https://otaku-collector.com/gravure-no-onna-yumi-enomoto.html",
            "url": "https://otaku-collector.com/gravure-no-onna-yumi-enomoto.html",
            "title": "Gravure no Onna - Yumi Enomoto",
            "summary": "This short 44 page story from manga artist Yumi Enomoto was published in the March 1994 issue of Lady's Comic&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>This short 44 page story from manga artist Yumi Enomoto was published in the March 1994 issue of Lady's Comic 禁断の愛の世界 Secret スクレ, a lady´s erotic magazine. The magazine started to focus on yuri content in later issues, ending publication in March 1996 and transitioning to \"Mist\" magazine, a lesbian/yuri magazine.</p>\n<p>These are the first 14 pages of the chapter.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P02.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P02-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P03.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P03-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P04.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P04-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P05.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P05-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P06.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P06-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P07.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P07-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P08.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P08-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P09.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P09-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P10.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P10-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P11.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P11-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P12.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P12-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P13.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P13-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P14.jpg\" data-size=\"4299x3035\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/6/gallery/Yumi-Enomoto-Gravure-no-Onna-P14-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
