        {
            "id": "https://otaku-collector.com/x-man-jiro-kuwata.html",
            "url": "https://otaku-collector.com/x-man-jiro-kuwata.html",
            "title": "X-Man - Jiro Kuwata",
            "summary": "I will start the original art section with this clasic, X-Man of Jiro Kuwata. This manga was published from 1960&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>I will start the original art section with this clasic, X-Man of Jiro Kuwata.</p>\n<p>This manga was published from 1960 to 1962 in the magazine Shonen Gaho, and is not related to the marvel title, created in 1963.</p>\n<p>X-Man is one of the first in the \"space era\" in the early stages of modern manga, focusing in spaceships and futuristic wepons.</p>\n<p>The author, Jiro Kuwata, latter create the classic 8-Man in 1963, and is also know for the \"Bat-Manga\" (Batman) between 1966 and 1967.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">At this time, I <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-4\" data-original-text=\"dont\" data-corrected-text=\"don't\" data-pos=\"20\" data-len=\"5\">don't</span> have info about the number of the magazine or volume where <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-7\" data-original-text=\"this\" data-corrected-text=\"these\" data-pos=\"89\" data-len=\"5\">these</span> pages were published, but I am still <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-12\" data-original-text=\"searchig\" data-corrected-text=\"searching\" data-pos=\"140\" data-len=\"9\">searching</span> !</div>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-16.jpg\" data-size=\"2386x3874\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-16-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1169\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-17.jpg\" data-size=\"2385x3874\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-17-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1170\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-18.jpg\" data-size=\"2372x3872\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-18-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1175\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-19.jpg\" data-size=\"2373x3876\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-19-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1176\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-20.jpg\" data-size=\"2382x3890\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-20-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1176\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-21.jpg\" data-size=\"2400x3900\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-21-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1170\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-22.jpg\" data-size=\"2400x3900\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-22-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1170\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-23.jpg\" data-size=\"2383x3887\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-23-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1174\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-24.jpg\" data-size=\"2384x3900\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-24-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1178\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-25.jpg\" data-size=\"2388x3900\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-25-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1176\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-26.jpg\" data-size=\"2377x3876\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://otaku-collector.com/media/posts/1/gallery/X-Man-26-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1174\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
